{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01AypUYgzJP1Xz1oASwpqxha","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: \"Phase gradient 本身稳健（跨模型/架构/benchmark 方向一致），但 strategy specificity 从 'universal emergent property' 降级为 'task- and architecture-modulated phenomenon'。LLaMA n=250 加大样本量后 imp_vs_rand 交互仍然微弱（d_z 0.25-0.35），仅 s030 稳定通过 Bonferroni，random 的非平凡 phase gradient 不消失。GPQA 进一步确认 phase gradient 单调性，但 imp/rand ratio 继续衰减至 1.5-3×，强化 task-dependence 叙事。论文需在 title 加 scope qualifier，abstract 降级 strategy specificity claims。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"c8_llama_n250_fixed\"\n    plan_id: \"c8_llama_n250_fixed\"\n    description: \"LLaMA-8B (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B) n=250 全 8 条件 (importance×4 + random×4 sparsity levels) per-problem paired 复现，验证 n=50 结论是否在更高统计功效下维持\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 250\n      n_valid: 244\n      n_bootstrap: 10000\n      bonferroni_k: 4\n      imp_vs_rand_dz:\n        s015: 0.21\n        s020: 0.27\n        s025: 0.30\n        s030: 0.33\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n        s015: [-0.01, 0.43]\n        s020: [0.03, 0.51]\n        s025: [0.07, 0.54]\n        s030: [0.11, 0.56]\n      imp_vs_rand_median_diff:\n        s015: 0.018\n        s020: 0.024\n        s025: 0.085\n        s030: 0.31\n      wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n        s015: 0.312\n        s020: 0.087\n        s025: 0.041\n        s030: 0.0082\n      significant_bonferroni:\n        s015: false\n        s020: false\n        s025: true\n        s030: true\n      phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n        s015: 1.02\n        s020: 1.11\n        s025: 1.12\n        s030: 1.01\n      phase_gradient_importance_median_diff:\n        s015: 0.34\n        s020: 1.05\n        s025: 0.38\n        s030: 2.89\n      phase_gradient_random_dz:\n        s015: 0.36\n        s020: 0.39\n        s025: 0.44\n        s030: 0.43\n      phase_gradient_random_dz_ci:\n        s015: [0.14, 0.58]\n        s020: [0.17, 0.61]\n        s025: [0.22, 0.66]\n        s030: [0.21, 0.65]\n      dose_response_monotonic_importance: true\n      dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n    result_rationale: \"n=250 相比 n=50 统计功效提升约 2.2×（√(250/50)），但 imp_vs_rand 交互的真实效应量本身就很小（population d_z ≈ 0.25-0.35）。LLaMA 架构的 GQA (grouped query attention) 使得 head pruning 后残余 attention pattern 的 strategy-dependence 弱于 MHA 架构（Qwen2）——pruning 掉一个 GQA group 影响更多 query heads，导致 random 和 importance 的 compound effect 差异缩小。n=250 的 tighter CI 使 s030（最大效应）和 s025（borderline）跨过 Bonferroni 阈值，但 s015/s020 仍 NS。Random 的非平凡 phase gradient（d_z 0.36-0.44）在 n=250 下 CI 完全排除零，进一步确认这不是 noise——LLaMA 上任何形式的 KV eviction 都触发 phase-dependent compound degradation，strategy specificity 是 architecture-modulated。\"\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: LLaMA n=250 imp_vs_rand interaction summary\"\n        columns: [\"Sparsity\", \"d_z\", \"95% CI\", \"Bonferroni p\", \"Significant\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", \"0.21\", \"[-0.01, 0.43]\", \"0.312\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s020\", \"0.27\", \"[0.03, 0.51]\", \"0.087\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s025\", \"0.30\", \"[0.07, 0.54]\", \"0.041\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"s030\", \"0.33\", \"[0.11, 0.56]\", \"0.0082\", \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: LLaMA n=250 phase gradient comparison (importance vs random). 左: importance 的 per-phase median II 显示强单调递增（d_z>1.0 全水平）; 右: random 也显示较弱但显著的单调递增（d_z 0.36-0.44），两条线斜率差异即为 strategy specificity 的可视化——差异存在但远小于 DeepSeek/Qwen 上观察到的 15-36× separation。\"\n    analysis: \"n=250 结果与 n=50 定性一致：(1) importance within-phase gradient 强且稳定（d_z≈1.0-1.1）；(2) imp_vs_rand 交互弱（d_z 0.21-0.33, small effect）；(3) random 非平凡 phase gradient 稳定存在。新增发现：s025 在 n=250 下跨过 Bonferroni 阈值（n=50 时 p_bonf=0.083, n=250 时 p_bonf=0.041），总 Bonferroni 显著条件数从 1 增加到 2。但核心叙事不变——LLaMA 上 strategy×phase 交互量级远小于 Qwen2 架构（d_z 0.33 vs DeepSeek d_z 0.80），C8 维持 partially_confirmed。论文措辞：'LLaMA replication provides directional support (2/4 sparsities significant) with architecture-dependent magnitude attenuation.'\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s015\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s015\"\n    description: \"GPQA benchmark (198 graduate-level science questions) DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking s=0.15，验证 phase gradient 在非数学推理任务上的泛化性\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 185\n      mid_null_rate: 0.22\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        high: 0.008\n        mid: 0.052\n        low: 0.19\n      per_phase_ii_mean:\n        high: 0.031\n        mid: 0.14\n        low: 0.48\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.182\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95: [0.11, 0.27]\n      wilcoxon_p: 3.2e-12\n      cohens_dz: 0.52\n      dose_response_contribution: \"s015 单调递增起点确认\"\n    result_rationale: \"GPQA 的推理链通常比 MATH-500 短（mean ~800 tokens vs ~1500），且推理类型更多样（物理/化学/生物实验设计 vs 纯数学演绎）。Phase segmentation 在短 sequence 上分辨率降低，high/low phase 之间的 token 数差距缩小，导致 compound interaction 的 phase-dependent 放大效应较弱。s015 是最低 sparsity，compound effect 本身微弱，但方向已可检测（median_diff 0.18 > 0, p<1e-11）。与 MATH-500 的 s015 median_diff=0.39 相比，GPQA 约为其 47%——这与 GSM8K 的衰减模式一致（GSM8K s015 DS=0.241, 约为 MATH-500 的 62%），GPQA 因推理链更短+更多样而进一步衰减。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"GPQA s015 的 phase gradient 方向正确且统计显著，确认 compound interaction 的 phase-dependence 不限于数学推理。但 absolute magnitude 约为 MATH-500 的一半，预示后续 sparsity 水平的 gradient 也将整体缩小。Cohen's d_z=0.52（medium effect）表明信号稳健但不如 MATH-500 上的 large effect。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\"\n    description: \"GPQA DeepSeek importance masking s=0.20，dose-response 第二点\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 182\n      mid_null_rate: 0.25\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        high: 0.021\n        mid: 0.18\n        low: 0.56\n      per_phase_ii_mean:\n        high: 0.072\n        mid: 0.41\n        low: 1.52\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.54\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95: [0.35, 0.78]\n      wilcoxon_p: 8.7e-22\n      cohens_dz: 0.68\n      monotonic_with_s015: true\n    result_rationale: \"从 s015 到 s020 的 jump 在 MATH-500 上约为 3.1×（0.39→1.21），在 GSM8K 上约为 3.1×（0.241→0.740）。GPQA 预期类似倍增（0.18→0.54, 约 3.0×），因为 sparsity 从 15% 到 20% 的 head pruning 增量对 compound interaction 的影响机制是通用的——更多 head 被移除导致 importance score 判别力进一步下降（Gini delta 加大），这个机制不 task-dependent。绝对量级比 MATH-500（1.48）小约 63%，与 s015 的缩减比例一致，表明 GPQA 的整体 'baseline severity' 较低但 dose-response shape 保持。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"s020 延续单调递增趋势。GPQA 的特点是 mid_null_rate 偏高（~25%），因为短 reasoning chain 导致 mid-phase segment 经常过短或不存在。这不影响 low vs high 的 paired comparison，但需要在论文中 report effective_n。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\"\n    description: \"GPQA DeepSeek importance masking s=0.25，dose-response 第三点，预期进入 steep gradient 区间\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 178\n      mid_null_rate: 0.28\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        high: 0.065\n        mid: 0.62\n        low: 1.73\n      per_phase_ii_mean:\n        high: 0.19\n        mid: 1.45\n        low: 5.21\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 1.67\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95: [1.08, 2.41]\n      wilcoxon_p: 2.1e-30\n      cohens_dz: 0.84\n      monotonic_with_s020: true\n      growth_factor_s020_to_s025: 3.1\n    result_rationale: \"s020→s025 在 MATH-500 上是 compound effect 急剧放大的区间（1.21→3.99, 3.3×），因为 s025 是 importance score discrimination collapse 的 critical threshold（D063）。GPQA 预期同样的 threshold 效应（0.54→1.67, 3.1×），因为 discrimination collapse 是 attention score 分布的固有属性，不依赖下游 task。但绝对量级仍约为 MATH-500 的 42%（1.67 vs 3.99），因为 GPQA 推理链短意味着每个 phase 内积累的 compound degradation token 数更少。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"s025 是关键转折点——如果 GPQA 在此处也显示 >3× 的 jump（相对 s020），则确认 onset threshold ~s020-s025 是跨 benchmark 通用的。这支持 discrimination collapse 机制的通用性假设。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\"\n    description: \"GPQA DeepSeek importance masking s=0.30，dose-response 最高点\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 174\n      mid_null_rate: 0.31\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        high: 0.14\n        mid: 1.35\n        low: 3.82\n      per_phase_ii_mean:\n        high: 0.42\n        mid: 3.8\n        low: 12.6\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 3.68\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95: [2.45, 5.31]\n      wilcoxon_p: 1.5e-33\n      cohens_dz: 0.91\n      monotonic_with_s025: true\n      growth_factor_s025_to_s030: 2.2\n      dose_response_full_spearman_rho: 1.0\n      dose_response_perm_p: 0.042\n    result_rationale: \"s025→s030 的增长因子在 MATH-500 上是 2.1×（3.99→8.48），比 s020→s025 的 3.3× 减小——这是 sub-exponential growth 的特征（C6）。GPQA 预期类似的减速（1.67→3.68, 2.2×），进一步确认 severity gradient 的 sub-exponential 性质跨 benchmark 成立。绝对量级为 MATH-500 的 43%（3.68 vs 8.48），与之前水平的 42-47% ratio 一致，说明 GPQA 的 'scaling factor' 相对 MATH-500 大约恒定在 0.43。\"\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: GPQA DeepSeek importance dose-response summary\"\n        columns: [\"Sparsity\", \"Median Diff\", \"95% CI\", \"Cohen's d_z\", \"Wilcoxon p\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", \"0.182\", \"[0.11, 0.27]\", \"0.52\", \"3.2e-12\"]\n          - [\"s020\", \"0.54\", \"[0.35, 0.78]\", \"0.68\", \"8.7e-22\"]\n          - [\"s025\", \"1.67\", \"[1.08, 2.41]\", \"0.84\", \"2.1e-30\"]\n          - [\"s030\", \"3.68\", \"[2.45, 5.31]\", \"0.91\", \"1.5e-33\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: GPQA vs MATH-500 vs GSM8K dose-response comparison. 三条单调递增曲线，MATH-500 最陡（0.39→8.48），GSM8K 居中（0.24→4.68），GPQA 最平缓（0.18→3.68）。三者形状高度相似（均 sub-exponential），仅 vertical scale 不同，支持 'phase gradient shape universal, magnitude task-dependent' 叙事。\"\n    analysis: \"GPQA 全 4 sparsity 单调递增，Spearman ρ=1.0，与 MATH-500 和 GSM8K 一致。这是第三个独立 benchmark 确认 dose-response monotonicity，极大强化 C2/C7 claims。Cohen's d_z 从 medium(0.52) 增长到 large(0.91)，表明信号随 sparsity 增强。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s030\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s030\"\n    description: \"GPQA DeepSeek random masking s=0.30，用于计算 imp/rand ratio 验证 strategy specificity 的 task-dependence\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 170\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        high: 0.72\n        mid: 1.15\n        low: 1.84\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 1.12\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95: [0.45, 1.92]\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.0034\n      cohens_dz: 0.22\n      imp_rand_ratio_s030: 2.1\n      imp_rand_ratio_interpretation: \"further decay from GSM8K 2.8×\"\n    result_rationale: \"Median tier 预测 GPQA 的 imp/rand ratio 在 1.5-4.0× 范围。GPQA 的多学科特性（物理/化学/生物）意味着 attention pattern 更加多样——不像数学推理有高度结构化的 'step-by-step' pattern 使 importance score 能有效区分关键 vs 非关键 KV。在多样化推理模式下，importance score 的 discriminative advantage 被稀释：(1) 不同学科的 'important' token pattern 差异大，importance metric 的泛化能力下降；(2) 推理链短导致 temporal structure 弱化，phase boundary 模糊。因此 random 的 phase gradient（median_diff 1.12）相对 importance（3.68）的差距进一步缩小，ratio 约 3.3×。但考虑到 CI 的 overlap，实际 point estimate 可能在 2.0-3.5× 范围。取 2.1× 作为 median tier 的 conservative estimate。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"GPQA 的 imp/rand ratio ≈ 2.1× 进一步确认 strategy specificity 的 task-dependence：MATH-500 15-36× → GSM8K 2.3-3.8× → GPQA 1.5-3×。衰减趋势与 task 的 'reasoning structure regularity' 相关——数学推理高度结构化（importance score 区分度高），GSM8K 结构化程度中等，GPQA 多学科混合结构化程度最低。这为论文 §6 Discussion 的 'strategy specificity mechanism' 提供了第三个数据点。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s015\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s015\"\n    description: \"GPQA DeepSeek random masking s=0.15，验证低 sparsity 下 random NS 模式是否在 GPQA 上维持\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 180\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        high: 0.09\n        mid: 0.11\n        low: 0.13\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.04\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95: [-0.05, 0.14]\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.31\n      cohens_dz: 0.07\n      bonferroni_significant: false\n    result_rationale: \"在 MATH-500 (n=500) 上，random s015 的 median_II=0.014 (DS) 且 NS (p=0.863)。GSM8K 上 random 也在低 sparsity NS。GPQA 预期维持这一模式：s015 的 compound effect 对 random masking 而言太微弱——random 不 systematically 破坏特定 phase 的关键 token（因为无 selection bias），因此 phase-dependent amplification 不触发。Phase gradient 的 median_diff 接近零（0.04），CI 跨零，NS。这确认了 onset threshold ~s020-s025 对 random 的跨 benchmark 通用性。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Random s015 NS 在 GPQA 上复现，与 MATH-500 和 GSM8K 一致。这对 novelty story 有利——即使在最弱化 strategy specificity 的 benchmark 上，random 在低 sparsity 仍然 NS，保持 'onset threshold' 叙事。\"\n\n  - name: \"reviewer_simulation\"\n    plan_id: \"reviewer_assessment\"\n    description: \"模拟 3 位 EMNLP reviewer 的评分和主要质疑，基于 median tier 的 claims scope 和实验证据\"\n    expected_results:\n      reviewer_1:\n        score: 3.5\n        confidence: 4\n        stance: \"weak accept\"\n        main_praise: \"Thorough empirical study with cross-model/architecture/benchmark validation. Statistical methodology rigorous (Bonferroni, bootstrap, effect sizes).\"\n        main_concerns:\n          - \"Novelty vs Physics of KV Cache Compression (Mar 2026): both study phase-dependent compression behavior. The distinction ('compression-rate phase vs reasoning phase') is acknowledged but could be more crisply articulated.\"\n          - \"7B models only. Camera-ready 13B/70B promise is appreciated but unverified.\"\n        novelty_challenge: true\n        fatal_concern: false\n      reviewer_2:\n        score: 3.0\n        confidence: 3\n        stance: \"borderline\"\n        main_praise: \"Important practical finding for LLM deployment. Discrimination collapse mechanism is well-supported.\"\n        main_concerns:\n          - \"Strategy specificity weakens substantially across benchmarks (15× → 3× → 2×) and architectures (LLaMA random also shows phase gradient). Is this really 'strategy-specific' or just 'strategy-modulated with diminishing returns'?\"\n          - \"Title/abstract still oversell given the qualification needed. 'Phase-gated' implies a clean gating mechanism but the phenomenon is continuous and noisy.\"\n          - \"LLaMA partial confirmation with only s030 significant at n=50 (now 2/4 at n=250) is thin for a 'cross-architecture' claim.\"\n        novelty_challenge: true\n        fatal_concern: false\n      reviewer_3:\n        score: 3.5\n        confidence: 4\n        stance: \"weak accept\"\n        main_praise: \"Clean experimental design. Crossover phenomenon is genuinely novel. Dose-response with Spearman ρ=1.0 across three benchmarks is compelling.\"\n        main_concerns:\n          - \"Practical implications unclear. C5b pilot failed. Without actionable mitigation, this is purely diagnostic.\"\n          - \"Would benefit from 13B results even as preliminary.\"\n        novelty_challenge: false\n        fatal_concern: false\n      average_score: 3.33\n      accept_probability: 0.35\n      meta_reviewer_likely_decision: \"borderline, leaning reject without strong rebuttal\"\n    result_rationale: \"Median tier 的 accept probability 在 0.25-0.5 范围。3 位 reviewer 中 1-2 位质疑 novelty（与 Physics of KV Cache 区分）。核心 phase gradient 无争议（跨 3 benchmark + 3 model 复现），但 strategy specificity 的 progressive weakening（从 15× 到 2×）让 'strategy-specific' framing 受到挑战。7B-only 是 major concern 但非 fatal（因为有 camera-ready 承诺）。Overall：两个 weak accept + 一个 borderline = 需要精准 rebuttal 才能过 threshold。\"\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Simulated reviewer scores\"\n        columns: [\"Reviewer\", \"Score\", \"Confidence\", \"Novelty Challenged\", \"Fatal Concern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"R1\", \"3.5\", \"4\", \"Yes\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"R2\", \"3.0\", \"3\", \"Yes\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"R3\", \"3.5\", \"4\", \"No\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Rebuttal 的关键任务：(1) 精准区分 Physics of KV Cache 的 'compression-rate phase transition' 与我们的 'reasoning-phase compound interaction gradient'——强调维度正交性（他们是单轴阈值，我们是双轴交互×phase 的连续调制）；(2) 将 strategy specificity 的 task-dependence 重新 frame 为 positive finding（揭示了 importance metric 的 'discriminative ceiling' 随 task regularity 变化，这本身是 novel insight）；(3) 承诺 13B/70B spot-check 数据在 camera-ready，并指出 mechanism（discrimination collapse）是 scale-independent 的理论预测。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":56978,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":56978},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02b67ff0-fc56-4182-8ec6-51406f6f7246","uuid":"3eaa0b5e-48c7-4f3d-b7c1-cfa0b4cba4ee"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":205724,"duration_api_ms":208142,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: \"Phase gradient 本身稳健（跨模型/架构/benchmark 方向一致），但 strategy specificity 从 'universal emergent property' 降级为 'task- and architecture-modulated phenomenon'。LLaMA n=250 加大样本量后 imp_vs_rand 交互仍然微弱（d_z 0.25-0.35），仅 s030 稳定通过 Bonferroni，random 的非平凡 phase gradient 不消失。GPQA 进一步确认 phase gradient 单调性，但 imp/rand ratio 继续衰减至 1.5-3×，强化 task-dependence 叙事。论文需在 title 加 scope qualifier，abstract 降级 strategy specificity claims。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"c8_llama_n250_fixed\"\n    plan_id: \"c8_llama_n250_fixed\"\n    description: \"LLaMA-8B (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B) n=250 全 8 条件 (importance×4 + random×4 sparsity levels) per-problem paired 复现，验证 n=50 结论是否在更高统计功效下维持\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 250\n      n_valid: 244\n      n_bootstrap: 10000\n      bonferroni_k: 4\n      imp_vs_rand_dz:\n        s015: 0.21\n        s020: 0.27\n        s025: 0.30\n        s030: 0.33\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n        s015: [-0.01, 0.43]\n        s020: [0.03, 0.51]\n        s025: [0.07, 0.54]\n        s030: [0.11, 0.56]\n      imp_vs_rand_median_diff:\n        s015: 0.018\n        s020: 0.024\n        s025: 0.085\n        s030: 0.31\n      wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n        s015: 0.312\n        s020: 0.087\n        s025: 0.041\n        s030: 0.0082\n      significant_bonferroni:\n        s015: false\n        s020: false\n        s025: true\n        s030: true\n      phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n        s015: 1.02\n        s020: 1.11\n        s025: 1.12\n        s030: 1.01\n      phase_gradient_importance_median_diff:\n        s015: 0.34\n        s020: 1.05\n        s025: 0.38\n        s030: 2.89\n      phase_gradient_random_dz:\n        s015: 0.36\n        s020: 0.39\n        s025: 0.44\n        s030: 0.43\n      phase_gradient_random_dz_ci:\n        s015: [0.14, 0.58]\n        s020: [0.17, 0.61]\n        s025: [0.22, 0.66]\n        s030: [0.21, 0.65]\n      dose_response_monotonic_importance: true\n      dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n    result_rationale: \"n=250 相比 n=50 统计功效提升约 2.2×（√(250/50)），但 imp_vs_rand 交互的真实效应量本身就很小（population d_z ≈ 0.25-0.35）。LLaMA 架构的 GQA (grouped query attention) 使得 head pruning 后残余 attention pattern 的 strategy-dependence 弱于 MHA 架构（Qwen2）——pruning 掉一个 GQA group 影响更多 query heads，导致 random 和 importance 的 compound effect 差异缩小。n=250 的 tighter CI 使 s030（最大效应）和 s025（borderline）跨过 Bonferroni 阈值，但 s015/s020 仍 NS。Random 的非平凡 phase gradient（d_z 0.36-0.44）在 n=250 下 CI 完全排除零，进一步确认这不是 noise——LLaMA 上任何形式的 KV eviction 都触发 phase-dependent compound degradation，strategy specificity 是 architecture-modulated。\"\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: LLaMA n=250 imp_vs_rand interaction summary\"\n        columns: [\"Sparsity\", \"d_z\", \"95% CI\", \"Bonferroni p\", \"Significant\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", \"0.21\", \"[-0.01, 0.43]\", \"0.312\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s020\", \"0.27\", \"[0.03, 0.51]\", \"0.087\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s025\", \"0.30\", \"[0.07, 0.54]\", \"0.041\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"s030\", \"0.33\", \"[0.11, 0.56]\", \"0.0082\", \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: LLaMA n=250 phase gradient comparison (importance vs random). 左: importance 的 per-phase median II 显示强单调递增（d_z>1.0 全水平）; 右: random 也显示较弱但显著的单调递增（d_z 0.36-0.44），两条线斜率差异即为 strategy specificity 的可视化——差异存在但远小于 DeepSeek/Qwen 上观察到的 15-36× separation。\"\n    analysis: \"n=250 结果与 n=50 定性一致：(1) importance within-phase gradient 强且稳定（d_z≈1.0-1.1）；(2) imp_vs_rand 交互弱（d_z 0.21-0.33, small effect）；(3) random 非平凡 phase gradient 稳定存在。新增发现：s025 在 n=250 下跨过 Bonferroni 阈值（n=50 时 p_bonf=0.083, n=250 时 p_bonf=0.041），总 Bonferroni 显著条件数从 1 增加到 2。但核心叙事不变——LLaMA 上 strategy×phase 交互量级远小于 Qwen2 架构（d_z 0.33 vs DeepSeek d_z 0.80），C8 维持 partially_confirmed。论文措辞：'LLaMA replication provides directional support (2/4 sparsities significant) with architecture-dependent magnitude attenuation.'\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s015\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s015\"\n    description: \"GPQA benchmark (198 graduate-level science questions) DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking s=0.15，验证 phase gradient 在非数学推理任务上的泛化性\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 185\n      mid_null_rate: 0.22\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        high: 0.008\n        mid: 0.052\n        low: 0.19\n      per_phase_ii_mean:\n        high: 0.031\n        mid: 0.14\n        low: 0.48\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.182\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95: [0.11, 0.27]\n      wilcoxon_p: 3.2e-12\n      cohens_dz: 0.52\n      dose_response_contribution: \"s015 单调递增起点确认\"\n    result_rationale: \"GPQA 的推理链通常比 MATH-500 短（mean ~800 tokens vs ~1500），且推理类型更多样（物理/化学/生物实验设计 vs 纯数学演绎）。Phase segmentation 在短 sequence 上分辨率降低，high/low phase 之间的 token 数差距缩小，导致 compound interaction 的 phase-dependent 放大效应较弱。s015 是最低 sparsity，compound effect 本身微弱，但方向已可检测（median_diff 0.18 > 0, p<1e-11）。与 MATH-500 的 s015 median_diff=0.39 相比，GPQA 约为其 47%——这与 GSM8K 的衰减模式一致（GSM8K s015 DS=0.241, 约为 MATH-500 的 62%），GPQA 因推理链更短+更多样而进一步衰减。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"GPQA s015 的 phase gradient 方向正确且统计显著，确认 compound interaction 的 phase-dependence 不限于数学推理。但 absolute magnitude 约为 MATH-500 的一半，预示后续 sparsity 水平的 gradient 也将整体缩小。Cohen's d_z=0.52（medium effect）表明信号稳健但不如 MATH-500 上的 large effect。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\"\n    description: \"GPQA DeepSeek importance masking s=0.20，dose-response 第二点\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 182\n      mid_null_rate: 0.25\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        high: 0.021\n        mid: 0.18\n        low: 0.56\n      per_phase_ii_mean:\n        high: 0.072\n        mid: 0.41\n        low: 1.52\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.54\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95: [0.35, 0.78]\n      wilcoxon_p: 8.7e-22\n      cohens_dz: 0.68\n      monotonic_with_s015: true\n    result_rationale: \"从 s015 到 s020 的 jump 在 MATH-500 上约为 3.1×（0.39→1.21），在 GSM8K 上约为 3.1×（0.241→0.740）。GPQA 预期类似倍增（0.18→0.54, 约 3.0×），因为 sparsity 从 15% 到 20% 的 head pruning 增量对 compound interaction 的影响机制是通用的——更多 head 被移除导致 importance score 判别力进一步下降（Gini delta 加大），这个机制不 task-dependent。绝对量级比 MATH-500（1.48）小约 63%，与 s015 的缩减比例一致，表明 GPQA 的整体 'baseline severity' 较低但 dose-response shape 保持。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"s020 延续单调递增趋势。GPQA 的特点是 mid_null_rate 偏高（~25%），因为短 reasoning chain 导致 mid-phase segment 经常过短或不存在。这不影响 low vs high 的 paired comparison，但需要在论文中 report effective_n。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\"\n    description: \"GPQA DeepSeek importance masking s=0.25，dose-response 第三点，预期进入 steep gradient 区间\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 178\n      mid_null_rate: 0.28\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        high: 0.065\n        mid: 0.62\n        low: 1.73\n      per_phase_ii_mean:\n        high: 0.19\n        mid: 1.45\n        low: 5.21\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 1.67\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95: [1.08, 2.41]\n      wilcoxon_p: 2.1e-30\n      cohens_dz: 0.84\n      monotonic_with_s020: true\n      growth_factor_s020_to_s025: 3.1\n    result_rationale: \"s020→s025 在 MATH-500 上是 compound effect 急剧放大的区间（1.21→3.99, 3.3×），因为 s025 是 importance score discrimination collapse 的 critical threshold（D063）。GPQA 预期同样的 threshold 效应（0.54→1.67, 3.1×），因为 discrimination collapse 是 attention score 分布的固有属性，不依赖下游 task。但绝对量级仍约为 MATH-500 的 42%（1.67 vs 3.99），因为 GPQA 推理链短意味着每个 phase 内积累的 compound degradation token 数更少。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"s025 是关键转折点——如果 GPQA 在此处也显示 >3× 的 jump（相对 s020），则确认 onset threshold ~s020-s025 是跨 benchmark 通用的。这支持 discrimination collapse 机制的通用性假设。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\"\n    description: \"GPQA DeepSeek importance masking s=0.30，dose-response 最高点\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 174\n      mid_null_rate: 0.31\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        high: 0.14\n        mid: 1.35\n        low: 3.82\n      per_phase_ii_mean:\n        high: 0.42\n        mid: 3.8\n        low: 12.6\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 3.68\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95: [2.45, 5.31]\n      wilcoxon_p: 1.5e-33\n      cohens_dz: 0.91\n      monotonic_with_s025: true\n      growth_factor_s025_to_s030: 2.2\n      dose_response_full_spearman_rho: 1.0\n      dose_response_perm_p: 0.042\n    result_rationale: \"s025→s030 的增长因子在 MATH-500 上是 2.1×（3.99→8.48），比 s020→s025 的 3.3× 减小——这是 sub-exponential growth 的特征（C6）。GPQA 预期类似的减速（1.67→3.68, 2.2×），进一步确认 severity gradient 的 sub-exponential 性质跨 benchmark 成立。绝对量级为 MATH-500 的 43%（3.68 vs 8.48），与之前水平的 42-47% ratio 一致，说明 GPQA 的 'scaling factor' 相对 MATH-500 大约恒定在 0.43。\"\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: GPQA DeepSeek importance dose-response summary\"\n        columns: [\"Sparsity\", \"Median Diff\", \"95% CI\", \"Cohen's d_z\", \"Wilcoxon p\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", \"0.182\", \"[0.11, 0.27]\", \"0.52\", \"3.2e-12\"]\n          - [\"s020\", \"0.54\", \"[0.35, 0.78]\", \"0.68\", \"8.7e-22\"]\n          - [\"s025\", \"1.67\", \"[1.08, 2.41]\", \"0.84\", \"2.1e-30\"]\n          - [\"s030\", \"3.68\", \"[2.45, 5.31]\", \"0.91\", \"1.5e-33\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: GPQA vs MATH-500 vs GSM8K dose-response comparison. 三条单调递增曲线，MATH-500 最陡（0.39→8.48），GSM8K 居中（0.24→4.68），GPQA 最平缓（0.18→3.68）。三者形状高度相似（均 sub-exponential），仅 vertical scale 不同，支持 'phase gradient shape universal, magnitude task-dependent' 叙事。\"\n    analysis: \"GPQA 全 4 sparsity 单调递增，Spearman ρ=1.0，与 MATH-500 和 GSM8K 一致。这是第三个独立 benchmark 确认 dose-response monotonicity，极大强化 C2/C7 claims。Cohen's d_z 从 medium(0.52) 增长到 large(0.91)，表明信号随 sparsity 增强。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s030\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s030\"\n    description: \"GPQA DeepSeek random masking s=0.30，用于计算 imp/rand ratio 验证 strategy specificity 的 task-dependence\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 170\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        high: 0.72\n        mid: 1.15\n        low: 1.84\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 1.12\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95: [0.45, 1.92]\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.0034\n      cohens_dz: 0.22\n      imp_rand_ratio_s030: 2.1\n      imp_rand_ratio_interpretation: \"further decay from GSM8K 2.8×\"\n    result_rationale: \"Median tier 预测 GPQA 的 imp/rand ratio 在 1.5-4.0× 范围。GPQA 的多学科特性（物理/化学/生物）意味着 attention pattern 更加多样——不像数学推理有高度结构化的 'step-by-step' pattern 使 importance score 能有效区分关键 vs 非关键 KV。在多样化推理模式下，importance score 的 discriminative advantage 被稀释：(1) 不同学科的 'important' token pattern 差异大，importance metric 的泛化能力下降；(2) 推理链短导致 temporal structure 弱化，phase boundary 模糊。因此 random 的 phase gradient（median_diff 1.12）相对 importance（3.68）的差距进一步缩小，ratio 约 3.3×。但考虑到 CI 的 overlap，实际 point estimate 可能在 2.0-3.5× 范围。取 2.1× 作为 median tier 的 conservative estimate。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"GPQA 的 imp/rand ratio ≈ 2.1× 进一步确认 strategy specificity 的 task-dependence：MATH-500 15-36× → GSM8K 2.3-3.8× → GPQA 1.5-3×。衰减趋势与 task 的 'reasoning structure regularity' 相关——数学推理高度结构化（importance score 区分度高），GSM8K 结构化程度中等，GPQA 多学科混合结构化程度最低。这为论文 §6 Discussion 的 'strategy specificity mechanism' 提供了第三个数据点。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s015\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s015\"\n    description: \"GPQA DeepSeek random masking s=0.15，验证低 sparsity 下 random NS 模式是否在 GPQA 上维持\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 180\n      per_phase_ii_median:\n        high: 0.09\n        mid: 0.11\n        low: 0.13\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.04\n      phase_gradient_median_diff_ci95: [-0.05, 0.14]\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.31\n      cohens_dz: 0.07\n      bonferroni_significant: false\n    result_rationale: \"在 MATH-500 (n=500) 上，random s015 的 median_II=0.014 (DS) 且 NS (p=0.863)。GSM8K 上 random 也在低 sparsity NS。GPQA 预期维持这一模式：s015 的 compound effect 对 random masking 而言太微弱——random 不 systematically 破坏特定 phase 的关键 token（因为无 selection bias），因此 phase-dependent amplification 不触发。Phase gradient 的 median_diff 接近零（0.04），CI 跨零，NS。这确认了 onset threshold ~s020-s025 对 random 的跨 benchmark 通用性。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Random s015 NS 在 GPQA 上复现，与 MATH-500 和 GSM8K 一致。这对 novelty story 有利——即使在最弱化 strategy specificity 的 benchmark 上，random 在低 sparsity 仍然 NS，保持 'onset threshold' 叙事。\"\n\n  - name: \"reviewer_simulation\"\n    plan_id: \"reviewer_assessment\"\n    description: \"模拟 3 位 EMNLP reviewer 的评分和主要质疑，基于 median tier 的 claims scope 和实验证据\"\n    expected_results:\n      reviewer_1:\n        score: 3.5\n        confidence: 4\n        stance: \"weak accept\"\n        main_praise: \"Thorough empirical study with cross-model/architecture/benchmark validation. Statistical methodology rigorous (Bonferroni, bootstrap, effect sizes).\"\n        main_concerns:\n          - \"Novelty vs Physics of KV Cache Compression (Mar 2026): both study phase-dependent compression behavior. The distinction ('compression-rate phase vs reasoning phase') is acknowledged but could be more crisply articulated.\"\n          - \"7B models only. Camera-ready 13B/70B promise is appreciated but unverified.\"\n        novelty_challenge: true\n        fatal_concern: false\n      reviewer_2:\n        score: 3.0\n        confidence: 3\n        stance: \"borderline\"\n        main_praise: \"Important practical finding for LLM deployment. Discrimination collapse mechanism is well-supported.\"\n        main_concerns:\n          - \"Strategy specificity weakens substantially across benchmarks (15× → 3× → 2×) and architectures (LLaMA random also shows phase gradient). Is this really 'strategy-specific' or just 'strategy-modulated with diminishing returns'?\"\n          - \"Title/abstract still oversell given the qualification needed. 'Phase-gated' implies a clean gating mechanism but the phenomenon is continuous and noisy.\"\n          - \"LLaMA partial confirmation with only s030 significant at n=50 (now 2/4 at n=250) is thin for a 'cross-architecture' claim.\"\n        novelty_challenge: true\n        fatal_concern: false\n      reviewer_3:\n        score: 3.5\n        confidence: 4\n        stance: \"weak accept\"\n        main_praise: \"Clean experimental design. Crossover phenomenon is genuinely novel. Dose-response with Spearman ρ=1.0 across three benchmarks is compelling.\"\n        main_concerns:\n          - \"Practical implications unclear. C5b pilot failed. Without actionable mitigation, this is purely diagnostic.\"\n          - \"Would benefit from 13B results even as preliminary.\"\n        novelty_challenge: false\n        fatal_concern: false\n      average_score: 3.33\n      accept_probability: 0.35\n      meta_reviewer_likely_decision: \"borderline, leaning reject without strong rebuttal\"\n    result_rationale: \"Median tier 的 accept probability 在 0.25-0.5 范围。3 位 reviewer 中 1-2 位质疑 novelty（与 Physics of KV Cache 区分）。核心 phase gradient 无争议（跨 3 benchmark + 3 model 复现），但 strategy specificity 的 progressive weakening（从 15× 到 2×）让 'strategy-specific' framing 受到挑战。7B-only 是 major concern 但非 fatal（因为有 camera-ready 承诺）。Overall：两个 weak accept + 一个 borderline = 需要精准 rebuttal 才能过 threshold。\"\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Simulated reviewer scores\"\n        columns: [\"Reviewer\", \"Score\", \"Confidence\", \"Novelty Challenged\", \"Fatal Concern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"R1\", \"3.5\", \"4\", \"Yes\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"R2\", \"3.0\", \"3\", \"Yes\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"R3\", \"3.5\", \"4\", \"No\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Rebuttal 的关键任务：(1) 精准区分 Physics of KV Cache 的 'compression-rate phase transition' 与我们的 'reasoning-phase compound interaction gradient'——强调维度正交性（他们是单轴阈值，我们是双轴交互×phase 的连续调制）；(2) 将 strategy specificity 的 task-dependence 重新 frame 为 positive finding（揭示了 importance metric 的 'discriminative ceiling' 随 task regularity 变化，这本身是 novel insight）；(3) 承诺 13B/70B spot-check 数据在 camera-ready，并指出 mechanism（discrimination collapse）是 scale-independent 的理论预测。\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"02b67ff0-fc56-4182-8ec6-51406f6f7246","total_cost_usd":0.678685,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":56978,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"output_tokens":10608,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":56978,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":10608,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation_input_tokens":56978,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":56978},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":51529,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.051639,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":10608,"cacheReadInputTokens":11447,"cacheCreationInputTokens":56978,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.627046,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"31551f6b-32aa-40ab-8a89-b462892e044b"}
